hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"392","[AI-translation] Haddasana Nasr bin Ali Al-Jahdami, haddasana Marhum bin Abdul Aziz Al-Attar, 'an Yazeed bin Babnoos, 'an Aisha ke Abu Bakr Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ke wafat ke baad unke paas dakhile howe, to unke dono aankhon ke darmiyan apne munh ko rakhha, aur apne haath unki bazuon par rakhhe, aur farmaya: wa nabiyyah! wa safiyyah! wa khaleelah!"
"393","[AI-translation] Haddasana Bishr bin Hilal As-Sawwaf Al-Basri, qala: haddasana Ja'far bin Sulaiman, 'an Thabit, 'an Anas, kehte hain ke jab wo din aaya jis din Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam Madina tashreef laye, us din unki wajah se har cheez roshan ho gayi, aur jab wo din aaya jis din unka intiqal hua, us din har cheez tareek ho gayi, aur hum ne apne haathon se mitti jhaadi hi nahi thi, jab ke hum unhe sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam dafn kar rahe the, yahan tak ke apne dilon ko pehchanna mushkil ho gaya."
"394","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Hatim, qala: haddasana Aamir bin Salih, 'an Hisham bin Urwah, 'an abehe, 'an Aisha, kehne lagi: Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ka intiqal peer ke din hua."
"395","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Abi Umar, qala: haddasana Sufyan bin Uyaynah, 'an Ja'far bin Muhammad, 'an abehe, farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ka intiqal peer ke din hua, to wo din aur manghwar ki raat guzri, aur raat mein unhe dafnaya gaya. Aur Sufyan ne kaha: aur dusre ne kaha: raat ke aakhir hisse mein khurpiyon (masahi) ki awaz suni gayi."
"396","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaybah bin Saeed, qala: haddasana Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad, 'an Sharik bin Abdullah bin Abi Namr, 'an Abi Salamah bin Abdur Rahman bin Awf, farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ka intiqal peer ke din hua aur manghwar ke din unhe dafnaya gaya. Abu Eesa ne kaha: yeh hadeeth ghareeb hai."
"397","[AI-translation] Haddasana Nasr bin Ali Al-Jahdami, qala: Haddasana Abdullah bin Dawud, qala: Haddasana Salama bin Nubait, 'an Nu'aim bin Abi Hind, 'an Nubait bin Sharait, 'an Salim bin 'Ubaid, aur unki suhbat thi, kahne lage: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam par unki bemari mein be-hoshi aayi, phir hosh mein aaye, toh farmaya: Kya namaz ka waqt ho gaya? Logon ne kaha: Haan. Farmaya: Bilal ko hukm do ke azan karein, aur Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko namaz padhayein, ya farmaya: logon ko namaz padhayein. Kahne lage: Phir unpar be-hoshi aayi, phir hosh mein aaye, toh farmaya: Kya namaz ka waqt ho gaya? Logon ne kaha: Haan. Farmaya: Bilal ko hukm do ke azan karein, aur Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko namaz padhayein. Aisha ne kaha: Mere abu naram dil ke mard hain, agar us muqam par khade honge toh ro lenge aur (namaz) nahi padh payenge, kash aap kisi aur ko hukm dete. Kahne lage: Phir unpar be-hoshi aayi, phir hosh mein aaye, toh farmaya: Bilal ko hukm do ke azan karein, aur Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko namaz padhayein, tum toh Yusuf ki sahelian ho. Kahne lage: Bilal ko hukm diya gaya toh unhone azan kahi, aur Abu Bakr ko hukm diya gaya toh unhone logon ko namaz padhai. Phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko halka mehsoos hua, toh farmaya: Mere liye dekho ke kis par takiya karoon. Barirah aur ek aur mard aaye, un dono par takiya kiya. Jab Abu Bakr ne unhein dekha toh peeche hatne lage, toh unhein ishara kiya ke apni jagah qayam rahein, yahan tak ke Abu Bakr apni namaz ada kar lein. Phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ka wisal hua. Umar ne kaha: Wallah, main kisi ko yeh kehte hue nahi sununga ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ka wisal ho gaya, warna use apni is talwar se maar dunga. Kahne lage: Log anpadh the, un mein un se pehle koi nabi nahi tha, pas log chup ho gaye, aur kahne lage: Aye Salim! Sahib-e-Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas jao aur unhein bula lao. Main Abu Bakr ke paas gaya, wo masjid mein the, main hairat mein rote hue unke paas gaya. Jab unhone mujhe dekha toh farmaya: Kya Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ka wisal ho gaya? Main ne kaha: Umar keh rahe hain ke main kisi ko nahi sununga ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ka wisal ho gaya, warna use apni talwar se maar dunga. Unhone mujhse kaha: Chalo. Main unke sath chala gaya. Wo aur log aaye jo Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas dakhil hue the. Unhone kaha: Aye logon! Mere liye rasta karo. Logon ne unke liye rasta chhod diya. Wo aaye yahan tak ke un par jhuke aur unhein chua, aur kaha: Tum marne wale ho aur wo bhi marne wale hain. Phir logon ne kaha: Aye Sahib-e-Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam! Kya Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ka wisal ho gaya? Unhone kaha: Haan. Logon ko yaqeen ho gaya ke unhone sach kaha. Logon ne kaha: Aye Sahib-e-Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam! Kya Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam par namaz padhi jayegi? Unhone kaha: Haan. Logon ne kaha: Kaise? Unhone kaha: Ek qoum dakhil hogi, takbeer kahegi aur namaz padhegi aur dua karegi, phir nikal jayegi. Phir ek qoum aayegi, takbeer kahegi, namaz padhegi aur dua karegi, phir nikal jayegi, yahan tak ke sab log dakhil ho jayenge. Logon ne kaha: Aye Sahib-e-Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam! Kya Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko dafn kiya jayega? Unhone kaha: Haan. Logon ne kaha: Kahan? Unhone kaha: Jis jagah Allah ne unki roh qabz ki, kyunke Allah ne unki roh sirf pak muqam mein qabz ki hai. Sab ko yaqeen ho gaya ke unhone sach kaha. Phir unhone hukm diya ke unhein un ke bhai ghusal dein. Muhajireen ijtema hue aur mashwara karne lage: Chalo hamare ansar bhaiyon ke paas chalen, unhein bhi is amr mein hamare sath shamil karein. Ansar ne kaha: Hum mein se ek amir aur tum mein se ek amir. Umar bin Khattab ne kaha: Jis ke paas ye teen (sifatein) hain, do mein se do, jab dono ghar mein the, jab apne saathi se keh rahe the: Gham na karo Allah hamare sath hai. Wo kaun hain? Kahne lage: Phir unhone apna hath phailaya aur bayit ki, aur logon ne khoobsurat tareeqe se bayit ki."
"398","[AI-translation] Haddasana Nasr bin Ali, qala: Haddasana Abdullah bin Zubair, shaykhun bahiliyyun qadimun basriyyun, qala: Haddasana Thabit Al-Bunani, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko mot ka sakht gham (kurbat) mahsoos hua jo mahsoos kiya, Fatimah ne kaha: Wa karbah! Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Aaj ke baad tumhare abu par koi gham nahi, yaqeenan tumhare abu ko wo cheez aa gayi hai jo kisi ko nahi chodti, qayamat ke din ki mulaqat."
"399","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Al-Khattab Ziyad bin Yahya Al-Basri, wa Nasr bin Ali, qala: Haddasana 'Abd Rabbih bin Baraq Al-Hanafi, qala: Main ne apne nana Abu Ummi Simak bin Walid ko hadith karte hue suna, ke unhone Ibn Abbas ko hadith karte hue suna ke unhone Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Mere ummat mein se jis ke do faratein (pehle faint hue bache) honge, Allah Ta'ala unhein unke zariye jannat mein dakhil karega. Aisha ne pucha: Phir jis ke sirf ek farat ho ummat mein se? Farmaya: Jis ka ek farat ho, aye mawaffaqah! Unhone kaha: Phir jis ke pas ummat mein se koi farat na ho? Farmaya: Toh main apni ummat ka farat hoon, mujhe jaisa kisi aur se nahi hoga (mere jaisa musibaat unhein nahi pohanchegi)."
"400","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani', qala: Haddasana Husain bin Muhammad, qala: Haddasana Isra'il, 'an Abu Ishaq, 'an 'Amr bin Al-Harith, Juwairiyya ke bhai aur unki suhbat thi, kahne lage: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne apna asla (hathiyar), apni khachchar, aur zameen ke siwa kuch nahi choda jo unhone sadaqa kar di thi."
"401","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna, qala: Haddasana Abu Al-Walid, qala: Haddasana Hammad bin Salama, 'an Muhammad bin 'Amr, 'an Abu Salama, 'an Abu Hurairah, qala: Fatimah Abu Bakr ke paas aayi, toh unse pucha: Tumhein kaun waris hoga? Unhone kaha: Mere ahl aur aulad. Unhone kaha: Mera kya hai ke main apne abu ki waris nahi? Abu Bakr ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna hai: Hum se waris nahi liya jata, lekin main unhein khilata jinko Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam khilate the, aur un par kharch karta hoon jinko Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam kharch karte the."
"402","[AI-translation] Haddathana Muhammad bin Muthanna, qala: Haddathana Yahya bin Kathir al-Anbari Abu Ghassan, qala: Haddathana Shu'bah, 'an 'Amr bin Murrah, 'an Abi al-Bakhtari, ke Abbas aur Ali Umar ke paas jhagadte hue aaye, dono mein se har ek apne saathi se kehta: tum aise, tum waise. To Umar ne Talha, Zubayr, Abdur-Rahman bin 'Awf aur Sa'd se kaha: Main tumhein Allah ki qasam deta hoon, kya tumne Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Har nabi ka maal sadqah hai magar jo wo kha le, hum se warasat nahi ki jati? Aur is hadith mein ek qissa hai."
